WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.910
Macross 7, up to now...

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:39.440
Lord Gepelnitch, aren't
we going to attack ?

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:42.310
Carry out your mission, Gigil.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:47.860
I'll steal your Spiritia,
which is swollen with terror !

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.710
Battle is senseless !
Listen to my song !

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:58.860
Let's go !

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.400
I'll put an end
to your Spiritia !

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:12.980
Where can I find the sound
that will reach their hearts ?

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:21.550
I can't resort to force !  I have to
get through to them with my song !

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.210
Answer me !
Why are you singing ?

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.170
Burning heart of passion -
that's singing !

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:31.740
Explain it so I can understand.
Why do you sing in battle ?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.100
I just want to see how
far I can take my singing.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.800
What's that
supposed to mean ?

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.290
Hey, I'm not finished yet !
Listen until the end !

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.400
Virgin Bomber

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.590
I thought I'd
find you here.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.110
You're going to
take them off ?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.200
Don't load missiles
onto my Valkyrie.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:43.470
It's because
of these, that I...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.560
You were only able to
save them by firing...

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.260
Stop it !

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.460
Were you able to save the girls
in Rex's gang with your singing ?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.620
Or when the Diamond Force
pilot nearly got killed ?

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:07.240
You never know what's going to
happen. Just leave them there.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.400
Ray, I'm just a civilian.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:13.800
Don't think about
it too much.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:19.110
It's just like taking an umbrella
along when you go for a picnic.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:26.030
But I like the rain. I'd rather
get wet than use an umbrella.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.410
I know.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.930
You don't have to use
it if you don't want to.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.850
But there's nothing
wrong with having one.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.060
This is a such
a nice place.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.510
Do you come here often ?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.310
Actually, this is
my first time.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.990
Have you decided what
you would like to order ?

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.610
Er, I...

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.210
I'll have a cream soda.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.140
Very good.
And what can I get for you ?

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.290
I...I...I'll have the same.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.210
Very good.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.260
I, umm...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.410
Yes ?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:16.640
Remember when we talked about that guy that
flies out and gets in the way during combat ?

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.920
I checked and it turns
out he was a rock singer.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.700
Oh, really ?

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.900
Do you know him ?

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.430
No.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.710
I see.
On the resort ship, Riviera...

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.010
Mylene ! Mylene !

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:41.170
...I saw him near you.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.190
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Here you go.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:49.910
I didn't notice.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:54.870
I wonder what kind of person he is, singing
like that with no thought of personal danger.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.510
Sounds like fun !

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:05.210
He's a self-centered guy who
keeps getting in the way ?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.560
I'd like to meet him.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.410
Let's see...

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.750
Here.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.820
Uh, er...no...sorry...

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.500
It's because you
stirred it so much.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.810
Mylene got some
recording work ?

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:31.520
Yeah.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:31.800
She accepted ?
Yeah.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:32.460
She accepted ?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.140
Yeah.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:35.860
Oh, man...

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.050
You don't like it ?

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.510
You know...I...

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:42.590
...can only get
into live performances.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.560
Give it a try.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:48.230
Recording is a totally
new era for Fire Bomber.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.790
Think of it
as a challenge.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.710
A challenge, huh ?

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.220
You sure are
a smooth talker.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.180
See you there, then.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.320
You already agreed
to it anyway, right ?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.170
Thanks for the soda. Bye !

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.850
Umm...Please take this.
I hope it fits.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.320
What is it ?

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.180
It's a kimono.
It's called a "tsumugi."

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.310
They say that when you wear this,
it calms the hearts of the people around you.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.460
Oh really ?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.600
Sounds like fun.
Thanks.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.470
I hope you like it.

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:29.310
I'd like it if you wore
it the next time we meet.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.540
Yeah, I'll do that.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.210
Goodbye, Lt. Gamlin !

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.240
Goodbye.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:47.810
It seems Mylene knows Basara.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.770
Why did she lie about it ?

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.010
Is there something
she wants to hide ?

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:53.510
Looks like things
are working out.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:54.660
C...Commander.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:59.630
If this works out, it will be a good
way to get close to Mayor Miria.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:03.680
That's a fast track to
becoming an elite officer.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.030
I wasn't thinking
of that at all.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:09.090
If you'd like,
I can introduce her to you.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.590
I'm much too old for her.
Well, keep it up.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:15.800
Let's get going.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.650
Order whatever
you like.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:19.310
Yay !

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.920
Such young women,
and two of them !

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:36.500
Let's get started, it's Saturday night.
How're you guys doing ?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.030
Let's stand up,
do you feel the beat ?

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:48.710
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:53.310
Now hurry up and take it back.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.310
No good, no good, no good, no good !

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.190
No more wastin' time...
No good, no good, no good, no good !

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:03.300
I don't need the passion,
let's make it fashionable !

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:10.510
A professional's job isn't
just self-satisfaction...

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:14.280
...the audience has to be
able to appreciate it, too.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:19.230
I want a popular melody that
anybody can understand !

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:20.750
Sorry, but we can't.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.600
That's not what we do.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:24.210
Basara !

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.820
What the...?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.860
I'm sorry, Mr. Suzuki.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.560
Call me Honey.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.980
Honey, I'll bring
him back right away.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:40.730
What's going on ?
Somebody explain this to me !

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.440
He's got a lot
on his mind. Right ?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.860
Well, that's about it...

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:49.200
Well, that's it for today.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.820
We can get back to
it some other day.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.150
Basara, what're you doing ?!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.570
What was that all about ?

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:10.590
What was what ?

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.970
Your attitude back there !
This's our first recording session !

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:20.150
Look, this's our big chance !
You should take it seriously !

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.760
What do you
want me to do ?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.190
Geez !  It's that attitude
I'm talking about !

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:30.460
You could have listened
to the director a bit more.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.560
What was there
to listen to ?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.010
That attitude again !

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:38.910
It was really immature to talk
back to him and walk out like that !

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:44.440
At this rate,
we'll never get recorded !

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:48.340
We have to do a recording
to reach a wider audience !

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:53.230
If you keep being irresponsible, no one's
going to hear Fire Bomber's songs !

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.310
Bomber.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:04.510
A sound that's more explosive than missiles.
The problem is finding that.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.760
I don't get it.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.710
What's with you ?!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.560
It's got nothing
to do with you !

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.210
It does too.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:21.310
A sound more
effective than missiles ?

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.340
Basara's really
getting to me.

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:30.250
There's no point in
arguing with Basara.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.350
Huh ?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:34.030
You can't try to
be rational with him.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.880
There were more
victims again today.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:44.960
The authorities have not been able to
make progress in the investigation.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.780
The citizens are becoming
even more frightened.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:52.650
I'm too afraid to go out. What are the
military and the city police doing ?

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.600
I wish they
would do something.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.860
As you can see,
the citizens are living in fear.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.790
The level of frustration with the
military and city police is rising...

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.610
...and more people
are voicing complaints.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.360
Let's hope that this crime will be solved,
and the criminals captured soon.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:12.960
Guvava, Veffidas said it
was useless arguing with him.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.750
How do you think
I can convince him ?

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:41.940
What's attractive about Fire Bomber
is their audacious performance.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:48.210
Just capture that in a recording, but
fashionably, as fashionably as possible.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.390
What's with that outfit ?

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.770
It's called a tsumugi kimono.
It was given to me.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.410
Really ?
Good for you.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:17.570
Basara, I realize there are things
about that director you don't like...

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:21.910
...but would you make an effort
to make things work with him ?

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.410
Please, Basara.

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.580
It won't work.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.690
What he likes,
I won't like.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.710
It's not gonna work.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:32.950
No matter what ?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:33.940
Right.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:38.460
Gamlin said if I wore this, it would calm
the hearts of the people around me...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.030
...but he was wrong.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.380
Basara hasn't
changed at all.

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:51.030
Oh, all right.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.920
I'll give it just
one more try.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:56.460
Really ?

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:57.660
Yeah.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:02.460
Cool ! It's just like Veffidas said,
you can't be rational with Basara.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.420
Lord Gepelnitch, I would
like to ask you something.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.860
What is it ?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:30.690
Every 500,000 years we have attacked
and robbed our prey of their Spiritia.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:37.190
And yet this time...why are we toying with
them, why aren't we attacking all at once ?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:42.260
Excellency, I would like to
know what you are planning !

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:46.100
Lately, I have been
dreaming often.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.000
Sir ?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:53.460
A dream of obtaining Spiritia
without having to hunt for prey.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.770
I do not know if this is
a dream or if it is real.

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:01.030
I will just say that this all depends
on the results of our investigations.

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:09.060
I have no idea
what that means.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.160
All I know, is that
chasing after prey is fun !

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.410
...a sad song of surrender.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:20.460
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.460
No, no, no !
What am I going to do with you ?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.310
We already have
a release date.

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:30.250
We need to get
this recorded today.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.270
Sorry.
We'll try harder.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:34.880
We're planning a big
advertising campaign, too.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.820
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:41.140
Are you people
serious about this ?

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.710
Oh no, another
enemy attack ?

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.140
Bomber.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.180
Basara !

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.420
Hey, what is it with you ?
I've had enough !

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.620
Do you just want to stop ?
I'm still going to bill you for expenses.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.630
Hold on a sec,
we can work this out.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:04.520
What do you mean,
work this out ?

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.070
Don't worry,
it'll work.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.710
Let's make this
one explode !

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.590
Enemy ships have penetrated
defense perimeter number two.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:28.220
Advance ship, Boroughneize,
engaged in battle.

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:47.460
According to the report, there are
several times more enemy ships than usual.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:49.970
Our formation
today is D-15.

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:50.860
Roger.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:54.010
Physica, stick close
to me and Gamlin. Got it ?

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.010
Roger !

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.460
Let's go !

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.090
That's...

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:13.750
I've spotted
the enemy leader !

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:20.080
Gamlin, don't forget,
formation D-15 !

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.360
This time
I'll get you.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.600
All right,
I'll play with you !

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.660
D-2, don't rush in !

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.960
Listen to my sound,
more explosive than missiles !

